### 8.3 污染引擎 (`src/lib/pollution.js`)

8 类纯函数 API：
- `calcEffectivePollution(envP, personalP, weights?)` → `{ effective, tier }` (5 tier: none/mild/moderate/severe/meltdown)
- `apply{Search|Combat|Interact|Pvp|EmergencyRetreat|MeltdownTraverse|PartRepair}Pollution()`
- `applyRetreatDecay(player, envPollution)` 低污染区(≤20%)自然衰减
- `tickEnvPollution(gv, mapAccelById)` 每 persist 一次按 5 + max(accel) 增长
- `tickOmegaCountdown(player, gv)` Ω 窗口归零强制传送至 map=3 + 个人污染 +20%
- `applyPollution{Search|Combat}Modifier()` 按 tier 修正搜索成功率/战斗伤害
- `recomputeFlags(gv)` 重算 envPollutionMax/Below60/lowFragments/totalEntityKillRate

